      "statement": "cert-manager v1.17 adds an optional literal-string `password` field to the Certificate resource's keystore sections (spec.keystores.jks.password and spec.keystores.pkcs12.password) as an easier alternative to storing the keystore password in a Kubernetes secret via passwordSecretRef, and the new field is mutually exclusive with passwordSecretRef so only one of the two may be set."
